@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      7-2
' realizes:     NFR-03, NFR-04, NFR-05, NFR-11
' source:       backend/src/models/, STT_Whisper/src/mongodb_uploader.py, database/tools/mongodb_uploader.py（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  partial
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 app-owned、Pipeline 與工具契約分群重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 資料儲存套件圖
left to right direction

package "backend models" as BackendModels {
  [identity and course]
  [video and batch]
  [QA and conversation]
  [notification and shorts]
}
package "MongoDB app collections" as AppCollections
package "Pipeline publication" as PipelinePub {
  [Leaf text segments]
  [Parent segments]
  [visual / audio artifacts]
}
package "database tools" as DbTools {
  [setup scripts]
  [mongodb_uploader.py]
  [legacy importers]
}
package "Atlas indexes" as AtlasIndexes {
  [source-declared indexes]
  [Vector Search indexes]
}

BackendModels ..> AppCollections : Mongoose read / write
PipelinePub ..> AppCollections : metadata bridge
DbTools ..> AppCollections : authorized upsert only
AppCollections ..> AtlasIndexes : indexed fields
PipelinePub ..> AtlasIndexes : embedding contract

note bottom of DbTools
  setup 與 legacy scripts 存在不代表可直接對 shared Atlas 執行；
  實際 collection、index 與資料品質須另做唯讀查證。
end note

@enduml
